//
// Dataset:
// MODIS MCD12Q1 Version 6.1
// Band:
// LC_Type1 = IGBP annual land-cover classification
//
// Study years:
// 2003–2024, because MODIS MCD12Q1 in GEE is available annually
// up to 2024 at the time of writing.
// ============================================================


