// ============================================================
// 16. INTERPRETATION NOTES
// ============================================================
//
// Use the rural-only QA table in your reviewer response.
//
// Important columns:
//
// mean_natural_vegetation_pct_land:
//   Forest + shrubland + savanna + grassland + wetland.
//
// mean_cropland_total_pct_land:
//   Cropland + cropland/natural vegetation mosaic.
//
// mean_builtup_pct_land:
//   Built-up pixels inside rural reference.
//   High value suggests possible peri-urban contamination.
//
// mean_disturbed_managed_pct_land:
//   Cropland + cropland mosaic + built-up.
//
// overall_reference_flag:
//   Simple interpretation label based on land-cover composition.
//
// Suggested response logic:
//
// 1. If rural natural vegetation is high:
//    The rural reference is mostly natural/semi-natural.
//
// 2. If cropland_total is high:
//    Acknowledge agricultural influence and vegetation phenology.
//
// 3. If built-up is high:
//    Acknowledge possible peri-urban contamination.
//
// 4. If cropland/natural mosaic is present:
//    Mention that rural reference includes mixed managed-natural
//    vegetation, which may affect seasonal LST variability.
//
// ============================================================
